# ✈️ Flights Dashboard | Power BI

An interactive Power BI dashboard that analyzes airline operations, flight performance, and passenger trends. The dashboard enables users to monitor key aviation metrics and uncover insights for data-driven decision making.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project transforms raw flight data into an interactive dashboard that provides valuable insights into airline performance, airport activity, and flight operations.

The dashboard allows users to explore:

- Flight performance
- Passenger trends
- Airport activity
- Airline comparisons
- Operational KPIs

---

## 📂 Dataset

The project uses multiple datasets including:

- Flight Records
- Airport Information
- Airline/Carrier Data

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Excel

---

## 📊 Dashboard Features

✔ Interactive Filters (Slicers)

✔ KPI Cards

✔ Bar Charts

✔ Line Charts

✔ Pie Charts

✔ Maps (if applicable)

✔ Drill-through Analysis

---

## 📈 Key Insights

- Identify the busiest airports.
- Compare airline performance.
- Analyze passenger traffic.
- Monitor flight delays and operational trends.
- Evaluate overall airline efficiency.

